2026-11-12T01:49:43.923-08:00 [reviewer] SENT topic="s0036_final" correlation_id="40baa9c0-9bdb-4e94-ba45-525652447080" status="approved" answer="**Risk Note for Management: CVE-2021-23337 in Lodash**  \n\nThis high-severity vulnerability (CVE-2021-23337) affects Lodash versions **prior to 4.17.21**. It enables command injection via the template function, potentially allowing attackers to execute arbitrary system commands. In business terms, this could lead to unauthorized system access, data breaches, or service disruption if exploited in production environments.  \n\n**Remediation**: Immediately upgrade Lodash to **version 4.17.21 or later** to resolve the vulnerability. Ensure all affected systems are patched within 72 hours to mitigate risk. Monitor for related incidents and validate fixes through security scans.  \n\n*(148 words)*\n\nSource record: VULN-0036-HW9-02 (s0036_rel id 20075): lodash affected < 4.17.21, severity high. CVE-2021-23337: Command injection through the template function. Fixed in 4.17.21."
2026-11-12T01:49:43.927-08:00 [reviewer] COMMITTED offset after processing correlation_id="40baa9c0-9bdb-4e94-ba45-525652447080" partition=0 offset=342
